# Card #531: the e2e lane's key is every file this context admits (lanes.yml),
# so what is excluded here is exactly what a push can change without re-running
# e2e. Keep this list to files neither the image nor the e2e step reads: root
# Markdown docs (`*.md` matches the root only, as in every .dockerignore), the
# licence, and agent/editor config. Never exclude source, e2e/, scripts/ or
# .woodpecker/ to make a push skip.
*.md
LICENSE
.claude/
.cursor/
# lane-skip's per-pipeline decision files must never reach an image.
.lane/
